  "body": "Final Call for your dream home! \r\n\r\nDon't miss this urgent opportunity to secure a stunning, modern 3-bedroom, 2-bathroom home! This is your chance to skip the lengthy search and step straight into a life of quality and convenience.\r\n\r\nInside, you'll find a sleek, modern kitchen that's a chef's delight, boasting quality soft-close cabinetry, stylish engineered stone benchtops, a waste disposal unit, and a full suite of stainless-steel appliances (induction cooktop, oven, rangehood, and dishwasher).\r\n\r\nThe open-plan living and dining areas are bright, comfortable, and future-proofed with dedicated internet, phone, and TV outlets, all kept cozy year-round by a heat pump.\r\n\r\nBoth bathrooms are finished to a high standard with designer vanities, quality showers, and the added luxury of heated towel rails and fan-heat-lights.\r\n\r\nStep outside to your private, timber-fenced courtyard with a deck, ready for summer BBQs and relaxation. The outdoor area is complete with planned landscaping and a garden tap for easy maintenance.\r\n\r\nThe vendors are committed to a quick sale. Delaying could mean missing out on this exceptional value! Your new life starts here!",
